     "line_id": "POL-p1-L1",
     "line": 1,
     "text": "1. Purpose",
     "style": "heading",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      87.2,
      127.13,
      99.0
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L2",
     "line": 2,
     "text": "This policy describes when Alderpoint Health Plan covers skilled home health services.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      103.8,
      460.58,
      115.6
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L3",
     "line": 3,
     "text": "2. Definitions",
     "style": "heading",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      132.88,
      138.79,
      144.68
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L4",
     "line": 4,
     "text": "Homebound: leaving home requires a considerable and taxing effort, and the member needs the help of",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      149.48,
      534.57,
      161.28
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L5",
     "line": 5,
     "text": "another person or a supportive device to leave home. Absences for medical care do not by themselves",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      163.08,
      530.1,
      174.88
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L6",
     "line": 6,
     "text": "change homebound status.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      176.68,
      196.63,
      188.48
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L7",
     "line": 7,
     "text": "Skilled service: a service that requires the skills of a registered nurse or a licensed therapist to be",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      193.28,
      505.06,
      205.08
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L8",
     "line": 8,
     "text": "delivered safely and effectively.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      206.88,
      214.95,
      218.68
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L9",
     "line": 9,
     "text": "Facility-based alternative: admission to a skilled nursing facility or an inpatient rehabilitation facility.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      223.48,
      512.27,
      235.28
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L10",
     "line": 10,
     "text": "3. Coverage criteria",
     "style": "heading",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      252.56,
      168.82,
      264.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L11",
     "line": 11,
     "text": "3.1 Standard criteria. Home health services are medically necessary when all of the following are met:",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      269.16,
      526.17,
      280.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L12",
     "line": 12,
     "text": "(a) A physician ordered the services under a written plan of care after a face-to-face encounter related",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      285.76,
      542.76,
      297.56
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L13",
     "line": 13,
     "text": "to the reason for home health.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      299.36,
      225.41,
      311.16
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L14",
     "line": 14,
     "text": "(b) The member needs intermittent skilled nursing or skilled therapy services.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      315.96,
      432.66,
      327.76
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L15",
     "line": 15,
     "text": "(c) The treating practitioner certified in the record that the member is homebound, with a statement of",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      332.56,
      538.86,
      344.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L16",
     "line": 16,
     "text": "the clinical findings that support homebound status.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      346.16,
      319.34,
      357.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L17",
     "line": 17,
     "text": "3.2 Visit limits. Up to 60 visits per benefit year across all disciplines. Additional visits require a new review.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      362.76,
      543.93,
      374.56
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L18",
     "line": 18,
     "text": "3.3 Home-based care in place of a facility admission. Home health services ordered in place of a",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      379.36,
      502.84,
      391.16
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L19",
     "line": 19,
     "text": "facility-based alternative are medically necessary, without certification of homebound status under 3.1(c),",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      392.96,
      539.52,
      404.76
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L20",
     "line": 20,
     "text": "when all of the following are documented:",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      406.56,
      259.98,
      418.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L21",
     "line": 21,
     "text": "(a) The member meets Plan criteria for admission to a skilled nursing facility or an inpatient",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      423.16,
      493.8,
      434.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L22",
     "line": 22,
     "text": "rehabilitation facility, as documented by the treating physician or a case manager.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      436.76,
      452.72,
      448.56
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L23",
     "line": 23,
     "text": "(b) The home setting was evaluated and found clinically appropriate and safe for the ordered services,",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      453.36,
      543.32,
      465.16
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L24",
     "line": 24,
     "text": "including caregiver availability when a caregiver is needed.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      466.96,
      352.1,
      478.76
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L25",
     "line": 25,
     "text": "(c) The expected cost of the home health services does not exceed the expected cost of the",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      483.56,
      498.33,
      495.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L26",
     "line": 26,
     "text": "facility-based alternative.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      497.16,
      202.04,
      508.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L27",
     "line": 27,
     "text": "4. Documentation",
     "style": "heading",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      526.24,
      159.9,
      538.04
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L28",
     "line": 28,
     "text": "Acceptable documentation includes the plan of care, the face-to-face encounter note, therapy evaluations,",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      542.84,
      544.59,
      554.64
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L29",
     "line": 29,
     "text": "case management and discharge planning notes, and home safety evaluations.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      556.44,
      427.3,
      568.24
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L30",
     "line": 30,
     "text": "5. Not covered",
     "style": "heading",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      585.52,
      144.91,
      597.32
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L31",
     "line": 31,
     "text": "Custodial care, homemaker services, and services that a caregiver without clinical training can provide",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      602.12,
      528.38,
      613.92
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L32",
     "line": 32,
